WEBVTT

00:00:54.759 --> 00:01:00.723
The great story is that Mister [unclear]
can improve his standard of living

00:01:00.765 --> 00:01:04.977
while removing CO2 from the atmosphere
and helping fight climate change.

00:01:05.686 --> 00:01:07.647
This is not about trees.

00:01:07.647 --> 00:01:08.856
It's much smaller.

00:01:09.524 --> 00:01:10.817
Sounds interesting?

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:12.568
Well, bear with me.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.695
In order to fight climate change,

00:01:14.695 --> 00:01:19.283
we need to reduce, like crazy,
our greenhouse-gas emissions,

00:01:19.325 --> 00:01:21.953
halving, in the next 10 years,

00:01:21.994 --> 00:01:26.290
the 50 billion tonnes
that we emit annually,

00:01:26.332 --> 00:01:29.627
and then aiming to halve again
in the following decade.